OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPerinatal depression: 'Everyone
OL,4,Atold me I must be happy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew mums told the BBC about their
OL,7,Fperinatal experiences, such as feeling
OL,8,Fthey should be happy when they were not
OL,9,Fand how sleep deprivation was "a form
OL,10,Fof torture".
OL,12,FA spokesperson for NHS Norfolk and
OL,13,FSuffolk Integrated Care Board (ICB)
OL,14,Fsaid: "We recognise that perinatal
OL,15,Fmental health difficulties can affect
OL,16,Fmany people and that early support is
OL,17,Fvital."
